    "Free prototype; Starter $20/mo includes 1 production instance; Pro $100 includes 5. App Builder $20/$100 credits are LLM credits, not compute credit. Containers 4/8 $0.24/h, 4/16 $0.28/h; included-instance shape not explicit so total cannot be accurately netted. Hourly charges stop when environment stopped.",
